{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"She nods. \"With everything going on, I assume it's important right?\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T09:58:39.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737609963094147172","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I wanted to talk to you about what you found tonight.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T09:59:04.691000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737610069457502219","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"There is a lot going on. But I want to make sure that you are alright first.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:00:55.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737610536144994325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Oh well...\" She lets out long sigh and her ears drop a little. \"It's hard worrying about your friends when you don't even know what you can say to them...\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:02:39.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737610972046426142","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"You can say anything to me leaf. I will always be your friend.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:03:28.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737611175008927765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"The archivist sets his flower crown on the table.","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:04:12.652000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-10T20:44:17.027000Z","id":"737611361139556393","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"To business now.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:04:24.850000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-28T10:04:32.373000Z","id":"737611412301414430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I am sure you have heard about Goanhawe.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:05:05.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737611582837751858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I would have you tell me anything you know about he and Kyree and a zone of truth.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:06:01.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737611818771677195","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Leaf looks like she follows until the last part. \"I mean, I've used the spell twice now, so I think I understand how it works, but I don't know anything about Kyree.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:08:01.426000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737612320687259729","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"There is trickery afoot little leaf. Don't let yourself be fooled by him. Perhaps your kenku friend would be willing to come with you if Goanhawe asks you to cast for him. The wandering note has a keen eye for trouble. If not, I will send Traxim Kiln or Vee.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:11:36.880000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-28T10:16:53.933000Z","id":"737613224366702663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I... I was wondering why he seemed so confident about me using zone of truth. He asked me to cast it while he reads a prepared statement at the observation deck tomorrow afternoon. I already figured he'd be chosing his words carefully, especially with something written ahead of time. Are you saying there's more to it than that?\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:16:53.360000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737614551779901482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Today he came to ask me for something, and I confronted him about his service to Solomon and offered him sanctuary within the Masons. His path it seems has not been set by intentions. But rather an anger. \"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:19:56.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737615318142419002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"You it seems are on the path of the redeemer. You are peace making cleric able to carry goodness to those around you in their many times of need.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:22:50.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737616049976901714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I offer you a tool.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:23:40.980000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737616261462360096","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Use the spell command rather than zone of truth. And tell him to confess.\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T10:24:42.420000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737616519160266782","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
